	<names>
		<name lang="en">GH104E HMI Green Enhanced, 10.4 in, 800 x 600, Ethernet, realistic view</name>
		<name lang="fr">GH104E IHM Green Enhanced, 10.4 pouces, 800 x 600, Ethernet, vue réaliste</name>
	</names>
	<elementInformations>
		<elementInformation name="manufacturer" show="1">Kinco</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="manufacturer_reference" show="1">GH104E</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="designation" show="1">HMI Green Enhanced, 10.4 in, 800 x 600, Ethernet</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">Kinco HMI Green GH (Enhanced) GH104E, 10.4 inch 800 x 600 operator panel. The terminals are the power plug, the DB9 pins of the COM ports (pin number and signal), Ethernet and the USB ports; the pinout comes from the GL070E manual, check it against the datasheet of your model.</elementInformation>
